<li><a href="#SSU">Southern Utah University</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a id="CCC"></a>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="802c0d4f"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/aac0550f9abe4793a69c0109e59a5e27/blablabla.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/aac0550f9abe4793a69c0109e59a5e27/blablabla.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/aac0550f9abe4793a69c0109e59a5e27/blablabla.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/aac0550f9abe4793a69c0109e59a5e27/blablabla.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Columbia College Chicago</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg">Columbia College Chicago har et stort antall kreative fag, og befinner seg i Chicago's "Cultural Mile".&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bVZHyqDQ1Dw">Informasjonsfilm&nbsp;</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.colum.edu/">Gå til nettsidene</a></li>
</ul></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['802c0d4f-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/aac0550f9abe4793a69c0109e59a5e27/blablabla.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Columbia College Chicago","htmlText":{"value":"Columbia College Chicago har et stort antall kreative fag, og befinner seg i Chicago's \"Cultural Mile\".&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bVZHyqDQ1Dw\">Informasjonsfilm&nbsp;</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.colum.edu/\">G&aring; til nettsidene</a></li>\n</ul>"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><div class="Richtext__wrapper"><div class="PageLayout__grid"><div class="Richtext__content PageLayout__content">
<p><a id="HPU"></a>&nbsp;</p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="560de89a"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/9dd73812ff014ebd972760bc7f56670b/hawaii-pacific-university-aloha-tower-marketplace-front-entrance-scaled.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/9dd73812ff014ebd972760bc7f56670b/hawaii-pacific-university-aloha-tower-marketplace-front-entrance-scaled.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/9dd73812ff014ebd972760bc7f56670b/hawaii-pacific-university-aloha-tower-marketplace-front-entrance-scaled.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/9dd73812ff014ebd972760bc7f56670b/hawaii-pacific-university-aloha-tower-marketplace-front-entrance-scaled.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Hawaii Pacific University</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.hpu.edu/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hawaii Pacific University</a> tilbyr Study Abroad-emner innen mange fag, og ligger <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hawaii+Pacific+University/@21.2916159,-157.8688424,13.14z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x6e3da4ff1d922e3d!8m2!3d21.3067033!4d-157.8654012">sentralt i Honolulu</a>.<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/usa/studentintervju-hpu-hawaii-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studentintervju med tidligere utvekslingsstudent</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hpu.edu/study-abroad/incoming-exchange.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Infoside Study Abroad</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hpu.edu/student-life/index.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Studentlivet Hawaii</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved HPU er som følger:&nbsp;<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra august - desember<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra januar - mai</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['560de89a-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/9dd73812ff014ebd972760bc7f56670b/hawaii-pacific-university-aloha-tower-marketplace-front-entrance-scaled.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Hawaii Pacific University","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.hpu.edu/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hawaii Pacific University</a> tilbyr Study Abroad-emner innen mange fag, og ligger <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Hawaii+Pacific+University/@21.2916159,-157.8688424,13.14z/data=!4m5!3m4!1s0x0:0x6e3da4ff1d922e3d!8m2!3d21.3067033!4d-157.8654012\">sentralt i Honolulu</a>.</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"/for-studenter/studier-i-utlandet/internasjonale-samarbeidspartnere/usa/studentintervju-hpu-hawaii-usa/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studentintervju med tidligere utvekslingsstudent</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hpu.edu/study-abroad/incoming-exchange.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside Study Abroad</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hpu.edu/student-life/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Studentlivet Hawaii</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved HPU er som f&oslash;lger:&nbsp;<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra august - desember<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra januar - mai"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
</section><section class="Richtext__block">


