<p><a id="Hartwick"></a></p>
</div></div></div><section class="Richtext__block">
<div id="8dc6cd90"><section class="_eq_qg_GewgPhGwcAzq8"><div class="j3a8ThoYc55mASLNSyjA"><div class="gU_G1Slvf8yBx2ryAztw"><div class="slJnKPGAAIKofsQwQBjL ZzhzXHPuPB7hJ0J9hHZ_"><picture><source sizes="(min-width: 1440px) 500px, (min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" srcset="/contentassets/8d6c450c6cb14b28850e034dc5f216d9/r.jpg?width=375 375w, /contentassets/8d6c450c6cb14b28850e034dc5f216d9/r.jpg?width=500 500w, /contentassets/8d6c450c6cb14b28850e034dc5f216d9/r.jpg?width=768 768w"><img src="/contentassets/8d6c450c6cb14b28850e034dc5f216d9/r.jpg?width=500" loading="lazy"></picture></div><div class="wU_SjsF8OT2a75wibltn"><div class="XC3UYwLQI6HU5ecnktFV"><h3 class="tPC6boHRNBJEqwqOsqQR">Hartwick College</h3><div class="RichtextContent _2jNkfmwAxq1ve9tHJyCg"><a href="https://www.hartwick.edu/academics/student-services/global-education/northeast-semester/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Hartwick College</a> ligger i byen Oneonta, New York. Det er et privat, liberal arts-college med en stor campus. Hartwick er kjent for et tett og inkluderende studentmiljø med fokus på "liberal arts in practice".&nbsp;<p></p>
<ul class="Richtext__ul">
<li><a href="https://www.hartwick.edu/academics/student-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Student Resources</a></li>
<li><a href="https://www.hartwick.edu/campus-life/housing/living-on-campus/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Student life Hartwick College</a></li>
