<li><a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Co_01Sy9U8Y" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>
</ul>
<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Hartwick er som følger:<br>- Høstsemesteret går fra august - desember<br>- Vårsemesteret går fra februar - mai</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><script>(window.__reactProps = window.__reactProps || {})['8dc6cd90-json'] = {"image":{"author":null,"caption":null,"url":"/contentassets/8d6c450c6cb14b28850e034dc5f216d9/r.jpg","alt":null,"focalPoint":null,"lazyLoading":true},"heading":"Hartwick College","htmlText":{"value":"<a href=\"https://www.hartwick.edu/academics/student-services/global-education/northeast-semester/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Hartwick College</a> ligger i byen Oneonta, New York. Det er et privat, liberal arts-college med en stor campus. Hartwick er kjent for et tett og inkluderende studentmilj&oslash; med fokus p&aring; \"liberal arts in practice\".&nbsp;</p>\n<ul class=\"Richtext__ul\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hartwick.edu/academics/student-resources/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Student Resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.hartwick.edu/campus-life/housing/living-on-campus/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Student life Hartwick College</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://hartwick.smartcatalogiq.com/en/2020-2021/catalog/about-hartwick\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Infoside Hartwick</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Co_01Sy9U8Y\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Presentasjonsfilm</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Semesterinndelingen ved Hartwick er som f&oslash;lger:<br />- H&oslash;stsemesteret g&aring;r fra august - desember<br />- V&aring;rsemesteret g&aring;r fra februar - mai"},"backgroundVariant":"transparent"};</script></div>
